(# Architecture, Security and Continuity Constraints) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Package: `Hospitality_OS_Phase_1_Clean_Build_Package_v2.0.9`) Tj T*
(- Canonical source root: `cd6b8cfc2175004cc2057deb7d9de1ad0d6264a23c82f00e15e96faa526c0c96`) Tj T*
(- Status: **Package M0 candidate - M0R and implementation are not authorized**) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Core architecture) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- multi-tenant and outlet-isolated by default) Tj T*
(- modular monolith with strict domain boundaries) Tj T*
(- versioned APIs and reliable events) Tj T*
(- exact money arithmetic) Tj T*
(- append-only or reversal-based commerce records) Tj T*
(- node-generated private keys and CSR-only certificate issuance) Tj T*
(- cloud is never a writable dine-in fallback) Tj T*
(- Phase 2/3 surfaces are physically absent from Phase 1 artifacts) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Tenant and outlet isolation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Missing tenant/outlet context must return zero rows and permit zero writes.) Tj T*
(- Use populated owner-side fixtures so zero-row tests cannot pass vacuously.) Tj T*
(- Test sibling outlets inside the same tenant, not only different tenants.) Tj T*
(- Test SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE.) Tj T*
(- Policies must contain both `USING` and `WITH CHECK` where applicable.) Tj T*
(- Adding `outlet_id` later must automatically strengthen existing policies.) Tj T*
(- API, jobs, files, caches, reports and sync paths are part of the isolation boundary.) Tj T*
(- Production services reject owner, superuser, BYPASSRLS and maintenance database roles.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Money and audit) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Do not use binary floating-point for money, percentages or quantity outcomes.) Tj T*
(- Accepted orders, issued bills, payments, tips and cash movements are immutable or reversal-based.) Tj T*
(- No tip is selected by default.) Tj T*
(- Bill allocation and tip allocation are separate.) Tj T*
(- A tip cannot hide an unpaid bill balance.) Tj T*
(- Refunds and reversals require purpose-specific step-up, permission, reason and audit.) Tj T*
(- Quick PIN cannot authorize sensitive financial actions.) Tj T*
(- Split bill participants may choose different tips.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
